Thanks for the advice from everyone who replied.  Here's what I ended
up wishing for:
1) 2 blessed scrolls of charging (only got one)
2) +2 blessed greased gray dragon scale mail
3) blessed master key of thievery
4) +2 blessed shield of reflection
5) blessed amulet of life saving
6) uncursed magic marker
7) blessed greased bag of holding

I decided rather than save the wishes, I'd use it all up in trying to
have everything I'd need to get to the castle.  I didn't find any bags
of holding in the mines, but I found the luckstone, and a cursed ring
of conflict which I put some holy water on.  While wandering through
the mines I ran into a Master Lich!  I think it must have come from a
bones file, since I was only level 10.  But it was actually
surprisingly easy to dispatch, since I have cold resistance & MKoT.
He didn't even curse my stuff, I don't know why.  Does MC2 protect
against curses?  Then later I was stuffing stuff into my bag and put
"a wand called teleport or cancel" into my bag of holding.  I was
quite upset with myself when it exploded.  Just goes to show, rushing
is the easiest way to screw up in nethack.  Anyway, I'm headed to the
castle, I'll try not to get killed by exploding drawbridge.  Wish me
luck.

